From 47308d280c27c120808774f90db0d7ced6a5c82f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:22:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(world): render neighbor-dependent block shapes

Bedrock omits the Java connection states for redstone wire, fences, and stair corners. Resolve each shape through one shared chunk update path, including multi-block packets and chunk borders, so later block types can use the same refresh mechanism without patching a redstone-only path.
